  "design": {
    "idea": "The False Throne offers a golden decoy Boss Key with a telltale NW shadow; touching it shatters the crown into an ambush and exposes the hidden Moon Pool (or pulse Lens to reveal it directly). Flipping to Black cracks the false dais into pits and raises the true Palace Boss Key!",
    "kind": "story",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "Reading NW lie shadows on treasures, using Lens on hidden Moon Pools, and uncovering Black World truth beneath Silver pageantry.",
    "decisions": 8,
    "expert_s": 50,
    "reward": "palace_boss_key+lore",
    "why": "Dramatic penultimate story beat paying off the Shadow-Truth law before facing the Queen in the Glass.",
